#: ../../windows.rst:2
msgid "Window reference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../windows.rst:4
msgid ""
"``WindowFunc`` is the common operator interface in PyHermes. A window may"
" smooth a field, define a separation bin, select a multipole, or apply a "
"mathematical operator. Its scientific role is determined by where the "
"task uses it, not by a separate class hierarchy."
msgstr ""

